#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Contacts, companies and your own details as .vcf cards, and a card file read in. Switched off, the downloads and the import are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "Kontakter, Firmen an Är eege Kontaktdaten als .vcf-Kaarten, an e Kaartefichier, deen agelies gëtt. Ausgeschalt ginn d'Downloads an den Import net ugebueden, an hir Adressen äntweren, wéi wann do näischt wier."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "DOCX"
msgstr "DOCX"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Extend file formats"
msgstr "Fichiersformater erweideren"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "GeoJSON"
msgstr "GeoJSON"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "iCalendar"
msgstr "iCalendar"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "ODT"
msgstr "ODT"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "OpenDocument text: a CV or a letter downloaded as an .odt file, and the text of an .odt you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "OpenDocument-Text: e CV oder e Bréif, als .odt-Fichier erofgelueden, an den Text vun engem eropgeluedenen .odt, deen opgehale gëtt, fir datt eng Sich e fanne kann. Ausgeschalt gëtt den Download net ugebueden an den Text vun engem eropgeluedene Fichier net gelies."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "PDF"
msgstr "PDF"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The companies' places as a GeoJSON file, out, and points read in that place a company's address by hand once you have ticked them. It needs Maps. Switched off, neither is offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there."
msgstr "D'Plaze vun de Firmen als GeoJSON-Fichier, eraus, a Punkten, déi agelies ginn an d'Adress vun enger Firma vun Hand setzen, soubal Dir se ugehaakt hutt. Et brauch Kaarten. Ausgeschalt gëtt keent vun deenen zwee ugebueden, an hir Adressen äntweren, wéi wann do näischt wier."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The file formats Postulo can read and write besides its own: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard and Europass. This is the switch for all of them at once; each can still be switched off on its own while this is on, and PDF cannot be. Switched off, nothing is offered in those formats and nothing is deleted: the files you have, and the data they were made from, stay."
msgstr "D'Fichiersformater, déi de Postulo nieft sengem eegene liesen a schreiwe kann: PDF, Word, OpenDocument, iCalendar, vCard an Europass. Dëst ass de Schalter fir all zesummen; all eenzelt ka weiderhin eleng ausgeschalt ginn, soulaang dësen un ass, ausser PDF. Ausgeschalt gëtt näischt an dëse Formater ugebueden an näischt geläscht: d'Fichieren, déi Dir hutt, an d'Donnéeën, aus deenen se gemaach goufen, bleiwen."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "The format a CV and a letter are made in: tagged, so a screen reader can read it. Always on; Postulo has nothing else that would still be a CV."
msgstr "De Format, an deem e CV an e Bréif gemaach ginn: getaggt, fir datt e Screenreader en liese kann. Ëmmer un; de Postulo huet näischt anescht, wat nach e CV wier."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "vCard"
msgstr "vCard"

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Word documents: a CV or a letter downloaded as a .docx file, and the text of a .docx you upload kept so that a search can find it. Switched off, the download is not offered and an uploaded file's text is not read."
msgstr "Word-Dokumenter: e CV oder e Bréif, als .docx-Fichier erofgelueden, an den Text vun engem eropgeluedenen .docx, deen opgehale gëtt, fir datt eng Sich e fanne kann. Ausgeschalt gëtt den Download net ugebueden an den Text vun engem eropgeluedene Fichier net gelies."

#: src/postulo/plugins/file_formats/__init__.py
msgid "Your calendar as .ics files and feeds, and a calendar file read in. Switched off, the downloads, the import and the feeds are not offered and their addresses answer as if there were nothing there; they answer again, at the same address, when it is switched on."
msgstr "Äre Kalenner als .ics-Fichieren a Feeds, an e Kalennerfichier, deen agelies gëtt. Ausgeschalt ginn d'Downloads, den Import an d'Feeds net ugebueden, an hir Adressen äntweren, wéi wann do näischt wier; si äntweren nees, ënner der selwechter Adress, wann et ugeschalt gëtt."
